sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as WebSocket client
  participant Connect as websocketConnectHandler
  participant DDB as REALTIME_CONNECTIONS_TABLE
  participant Agg as realtimeAggregationSqsHandler
  participant SRP as SocketRealtimePublisher
  participant AGS as ApiGatewaySocketService
  participant CR as DynamoDbConnectionResolver
  participant API as API Gateway postToConnection

  Client->>Connect: $connect ?channels=ALERTS
  Connect->>DDB: registerSubscriptions(connId, destinations)

  Note over Agg: alert / aggregation event
  Agg->>SRP: publish RealtimeMessage
  SRP->>AGS: publish(USER#DOC123, payload)
  AGS->>CR: resolve("USER#DOC123")
  CR->>DDB: Query DestinationIndex
  DDB-->>CR: ["conn-abc", "conn-def"]
  CR-->>AGS: connectionIds
  AGS->>API: PostToConnection for each id
  API->>Client: JSON message
